    &lt;div class="layout__region layout__region--content"&gt;
      
            &lt;div property="schema:text" class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"&gt; php global $base_url; ?&gt;

&lt;div class="container"&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;div class="row justify-content-md-center"&gt;
        &lt;div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3"&gt;
            &lt;h2&gt;
                Websites
            &lt;/h2&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;
                We make websites adapted to each client and project. We implement the Drupal content manager (CRM, ERP and online stores). We take care of everything... from graphic design to web development and hosting. With tools that improve the online management of your business or organization.
            &lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p class="text-align-center"&gt;
                &lt;img style="width:75%;" src="https://www.hayqueverlo.com/sites/default/files/hayqueverlo-webs.svg" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3"&gt;
            &lt;h2&gt;
                Multiplatform
            &lt;/h2&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;
                Adaptation of content to mobile devices (Responsive Web Design). We develop publishing systems to generate content adapted to all types of screens.
            &lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p class="text-align-center"&gt;
                &lt;img style="width:75%;" src="https://www.hayqueverlo.com/sites/default/files/hayqueverlo-multiplataforma.svg" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3"&gt;
            &lt;h2&gt;
                Advertising, Marketing and Social Media Strategy
            &lt;/h2&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;
                Landing pages. Automation of tasks for content management on websites and social networks.
                &lt;br /&gt;
                Development of multichannel campaigns.
                &lt;br /&gt;
                Results monitoring.
            &lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p class="text-align-center"&gt;
                &lt;img style="width:75%;" src="https://www.hayqueverlo.com/sites/default/files/hayqueverlo-redes_sociales.svg" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3"&gt;
            &lt;h2&gt;
                Multimedia Design
            &lt;/h2&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;
                Improve the image of your website and increase the quality of the content.
                &lt;br /&gt;
                Corporate logos and brands.
                &lt;br /&gt;
                Video making.
                &lt;br /&gt;
                Layout of online content.
            &lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p class="text-align-center"&gt;
                &lt;img style="width:75%;" src="https://www.hayqueverlo.com/sites/default/files/hayqueverlo-multimedia-v2.svg" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class="row justify-content-md-center"&gt;
        &lt;div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6"&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

            &lt;h2 class="text-align-center"&gt;
                We Love Free Software
            &lt;/h2&gt;
            &lt;p class="text-align-center"&gt;
                We promote the use of free software and standard web formats.
            &lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p class="text-align-center"&gt;
                &lt;img style="width:35%;" src="https://www.hayqueverlo.com/sites/default/files/hayqueverlo-free-software.svg" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
      
